{"sha": "aec96d2af3bc21388cf8da8f45faebc316b64839268807fe4df59280c3bad54f", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}, scale=1.0]", "  % outer insulated jacket", "  \\draw[thick, fill=gray!8] (-2.6,-0.2) rectangle (2.6,4.4);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=white] (-2.3,0.1) rectangle (2.3,4.1);", "  % water bath", "  \\fill[omDef!12] (-2.3,0.1) rectangle (2.3,3.4);", "  \\draw[omDef!60] (-2.3,3.4) -- (2.3,3.4);", "  % bomb", "  \\draw[very thick, fill=gray!35] (-0.75,0.5) rectangle (0.75,2.6);", "  \\draw[very thick, fill=gray!55] (-0.9,2.6) rectangle (0.9,2.85);", "  \\draw[thick] (-0.3,1.0) -- (-0.3,1.9) (0.3,1.0) -- (0.3,1.9);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=orange!50] (-0.3,0.95) rectangle (0.3,1.05);", "  \\draw[red!70!black, thick, decorate, decoration={zigzag, amplitude=1pt, segment length=3pt}] (-0.3,1.9) -- (0.3,1.9);", "  % wires", "  \\draw (-0.3,2.85) -- (-0.3,4.7) (0.3,2.85) -- (0.3,4.7);", "  % stirrer and thermometer", "  \\draw[thick] (1.6,0.6) -- (1.6,4.7);", "  \\draw[thick, fill=gray!40] (1.35,0.55) rectangle (1.85,0.75);", "  \\pic[transform shape] at (-1.6,0.4) {thermometer};", "  % labels", "  \\draw (-0.75,1.6) -- (-3.3,1.6) node[left] {钢制弹式容器，充 \\ce{O2} 至 30 bar};", "  \\draw (0,1.0) -- (-3.3,0.6) node[left] {样品及样品皿};", "  \\draw (0,1.9) -- (-3.3,2.6) node[left] {点火丝};", "  \\draw (1.0,3.0) -- (3.3,3.0) node[right] {水浴};", "  \\draw (1.6,3.9) -- (3.3,4.3) node[right] {搅拌器};", "  \\draw (-1.6,3.4) -- (-3.3,3.6) node[left] {温度计};", "  \\draw (2.45,0.3) -- (3.3,0.5) node[right] {绝热外套};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 弹式量热计。样品在加压氧气中恒容燃烧，", "热量进入弹体与被搅拌的水中，", "其温升由温度计读出。量热计的热容", "预先通过燃烧一已知能量的标准物质求得。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[量热法]\\label{met:b2:reaction-enthalpy:calorimetry}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 标定：燃烧一定质量的已知燃烧能的标准物质", "        （或通入已知电能），测得温升", "        $\\Delta T$，据此求得整个量热计的热容 $C$", "        （水与容器，即其“水当量”）。", "  \\item 燃烧样品，读出 $\\Delta T'$：放出的热量为 $C\\,\\Delta", "        T'$，故恒容下 $\\Delta_r U = -C\\Delta T'/\\xi$。", "  \\item 修正至 $\\Delta_r H$，修正量为 $\\Delta\\nu_{\\text{gas}}RT$；在敞口", "        （定压）量热计中，$\\Delta_r H = -C\\Delta T'/\\xi$", "        直接得出。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[弹式量热测量]\\label{ex:b2:reaction-enthalpy:bomb}", "对于丁烷燃烧生成液态水的反应，$\\Delta\\nu_{\\text{gas}} = 4", "- 1 - 6.5 = -3.5$，故 $\\Delta_r U = \\Delta_r H + 3.5RT = -2877.6 + 8.7 =", "\\qty{-2868.9}{kJ/mol}$：修正量仅为千分之几，大于", "良好弹式量热测量的不确定度，因此决不可省略。", "% ledger: dfh:C4H10_g, dfh:CO2, dfh:H2O-l (computed in figdata/bachelor-2/thermo-data.py)", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{history}[量热弹，1881 年]", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.2\\linewidth}\\vspace{0pt}", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book3/berthelot.jpg}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.76\\linewidth}\\vspace{0pt}", "马塞兰·贝特洛（1827--1907）用压缩", "氧气在内衬铂的密闭钢容器中燃烧有机化合物，使", "燃烧完全且无物质逸出：量热弹至今", "仍是测定燃烧热的标准仪器。他还创造了", "“放热”和“吸热”两词。（照片：公有领域，Wikimedia", "Commons）", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{history}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:reaction-enthalpy:1}", "利用本章的标准摩尔生成焓，计算", "丙烷燃烧反应在 \\qty{298}{K} 下的 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ$，", "\\ce{C3H8(g) + 5O2(g) -> 3CO2(g) + 4H2O(l)}，已知 $\\Delta_f", "H^\\circ(\\ce{C3H8}, \\text{g}) = \\qty{-104.7}{kJ/mol}$。该反应是否", "放热？", "% ledger: dfh:C3H8_g", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:reaction-enthalpy:2}", "计算燃烧 \\qty{1.00}{kg} 甲烷（生成液态水）及", "\\qty{1.00}{kg} 氢气所放出的热量，\\ce{H2(g) + 1/2O2(g) ->", "H2O(l)}。哪种燃料每千克放出的热量更多？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:reaction-enthalpy:3}", "弹式量热计给出液态苯燃烧的 $\\Delta_r U = \\qty{-3264}{kJ/mol}$，", "反应式为 \\ce{C6H6(l) + 15/2O2(g) -> 6CO2(g) + 3H2O(l)}，温度为", "\\qty{298}{K}，计算 $\\Delta_r H$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:reaction-enthalpy:4}", "已知 $\\Delta_r H^\\circ = \\qty{-393.5}{kJ/mol}$，对应反应 \\ce{C(s) + O2(g) ->", "CO2(g)}；$\\Delta_r H^\\circ = \\qty{-283.0}{kJ/mol}$，对应反应 \\ce{CO(g) +", "1/2O2(g) -> CO2(g)}，计算 \\ce{CO2(g) + C(s) -> 2CO(g)}", "的反应焓，该反应发生在高炉的炽热焦炭中。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b2:reaction-enthalpy:5}", "利用本章的键焓估算", "\\ce{CH4(g) + Cl2(g) -> CH3Cl(g) + HCl(g)}的焓变，取", "C--Cl 键焓为 \\qty{350}{kJ/mol}。再由生成焓计算同一量，", "已知 $\\Delta_f H^\\circ(\\ce{CH3Cl}, \\text{g}) = \\qty{-83.7}{kJ/mol}$，并", "讨论两者的差异。", "% ledger: dfh:CH3Cl_g", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}